ARIA
====

ARIA was created by Peter Semmelhack (https://psem.me/). MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

Vendored NetComposer libraries are in vendor/ (each with its own LICENSE and NOTICE).

src/mseed.ts and src/seedlink.ts are ported from Ground Wave (netcomposer-art/calliope, lab/ground-wave/, MIT).
The SeedLink-over-WebSocket details follow seisplotjs (MIT, Philip Crotwell).

public/anmo-2010-02-27.mseed: ten minutes of IU.ANMO.00.BHZ (Albuquerque, New Mexico), 27 February 2010,
Global Seismograph Network (IU), Albuquerque Seismological Laboratory / USGS, doi:10.7914/SN/IU, through the
EarthScope Consortium's data services.

tests/fixtures/*.mseed are libmseed and ObsPy test files (libmseed: Apache-2.0, EarthScope Consortium;
ObsPy: LGPL-3.0, test data); obspy-ref.json is ObsPy 1.5.1's decoding of them, made by scripts/obspy-ref.py.
